  "geo": {
    "note": "ONE SOURCE OF TRUTH. lib/map.tsx implements the real Mercator formula and projects the real Natural Earth 110m outlines in src/lib/geo/world.ts. The distortion on screen is COMPUTED by our own code, and the on-screen inflation counter is measured (shoelace) off the projected polygon — the map lies on camera the way it lies on a wall. Nothing here is a hand-tuned scale animation.",
